    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"LoggingintoBahmni-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The providers will be created by hospital admin in OpenMRS admin module. The password will be set by the administrator. Using that password the user will login for the first time. Post that, the change password feature enables all the providers to change their password in Bahmni.</span></p><h2 id=\"LoggingintoBahmni-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This feature can be used by any providers who can login to Bahmni system</span></p><h2 id=\"LoggingintoBahmni-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h3 id=\"LoggingintoBahmni-LogintoBahmni\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Login to Bahmni</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Enter your Username, Password provided by the admin (for initial login) or your changed password and select your Location.</span></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"238\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/image2017-3-27_14-47-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490606249542&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=238&amp;height=132\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114361274/image2017-3-27_14-47-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490606249542&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"584\" data-width=\"1052\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115721427\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-27_14-47-24.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114361274\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"c40f2306-6652-4ae1-aede-c3ab5295f8ef\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/image2017-3-27_14-47-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490606249542&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=476&amp;height=264 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/image2017-3-27_14-47-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490606249542&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=238&amp;height=132 1x\"></span><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Login Screen</span></strong><br/></p><h3 id=\"LoggingintoBahmni-ChangePassword\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Change Password</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">In Bahmni, any logged in user can change the password. So the individual users do not need to depend on the admin to change the password. This option is available only on home dashboard.</span></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/change_password_option.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864275873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=367&amp;height=147\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114361274/change_password_option.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864275873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"250\" data-width=\"624\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114401624\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"change_password_option.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114361274\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"a36d955d-1dff-4098-8036-1fb25600ae90\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/change_password_option.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864275873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=624&amp;height=250 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114361274/change_password_option.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864275873&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=367&amp;height=147 1x\"></span><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Home Dashboard</span></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Once the user selects Change Password, he/she will be automatically redirected to the </span><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">change password</span></strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> page.</span></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114360597/change_pwd.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864040172&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=367&amp;height=139\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114360597/change_pwd.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864040172&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"250\" data-width=\"660\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114401550\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"change_pwd.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114360597\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"f77015d6-4aac-4a64-8476-233e719c8cd3\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114360597/change_pwd.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864040172&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=660&amp;height=250 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114360597/change_pwd.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1485864040172&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=367&amp;height=139 1x\"></span><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Change Password</span></strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Page</span></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Once the password changed successfully user can go back to home dashboard by clicking on the home icon available in change password page.</span><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"37e96e45-f6af-4ebf-9689-bed8cf5a9022\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. As the screens and workflows are not constant across all installations of Bahmni, we have refrained from prescribing them. </span></strong></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to the Guides below for further details about the feature.</span></strong></p></div></div><p><br/></p><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"1f51babb-4e37-4f3d-a9db-69806a49d54f\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114560886/Bahmni+Login\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114560886\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni Login - Feature Guide</span></a></p>\n</div></div><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
